### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### List cities
GET http://localhost:8000/cities

### PM2.5 forecast for New York
GET http://localhost:8000/forecast/new-york?pollutant=pm25&hours=48

### O3 forecast for Los Angeles
GET http://localhost:8000/forecast/los-angeles?pollutant=o3

### Invalid city (should 404)
GET http://localhost:8000/forecast/atlantis

### Invalid pollutant (should 400)
GET http://localhost:8000/forecast/new-york?pollutant=methane